# Shared workflow rules

* Work on one approved story at a time.
* The specifier asks questions and obtains approval before coder handoff.
* Intermediate roles forward the exact committed task state downstream.
* Preserve the stable task name across the role chain.
* Batch only independent queued tasks and only in roles configured for batches.
* The QA terminal broadcast is merge-only.
* Do not start the next story until the current story is complete.
